{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "151a239947ffee8dfb225a1a7fe7c1f8725be42cddb172e328262738bc0b9c14", "ja": "心をアップグレード", "zh": "心境升级", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "63ff858d0a0235043a166c45225f25358f60b8a5b9c6d6ef52a8b56947a4ba0a", "ja": "ロコを元気づけるため、エレナと育は自分達\nなりに、ヨルノの研究ノートを作り上げた。\nプロデューサーの手から受け取ったロコは、\nやっと今のヨルノを受け入れる。そして対談\nの日、気持ちを込めた絵を手渡すのだった。", "zh": "为了鼓励ROCO，艾蕾娜和育按照自己的方式，完成了夜野的研究笔记。\n从制作人手中接过ROCO后，终于接受了现在的夜野。到了对谈那天，她将一幅饱含心意的画交了出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cc9b2612c8d563df6201c98c933f90a49c31cc6a518bf685b2ffc0aed155b61a", "ja": "（レッスンは順調だけど、ロコはまだ悩んでいる\n様子だ。一度、しっかり話をした方がいいかな……）", "zh": "（练习进行得很顺利，但ROCO似乎还在烦恼。是不是该找她好好谈谈呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5c27394aa78a8a4b7ef48211939ae84dadb41d5beaac33afe2dc00ba2c477b8f", "ja": "……ん？　エレナ、育。お疲れさま。\n今日のレッスンは、もう終わったんじゃなかったか？", "zh": "……嗯？艾蕾娜、育。辛苦了。\n今天的练习不是已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "85d4851a708643b6461d75d3b3969ace7f1cf666c5bdd0fcebf94d08e8a6f869", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　今ね、ロコに\n元気になってもらえるようにって、作戦会議してたノ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！我们刚才正在ROCO开作战会议，想着要让对方打起精神来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "b7754846d9b458deccf3e5f1d1d28c39b58d40034a84c4e9f8ce5ad119bdf6de", "ja": "わたし達、『レオ』の仲間だもん！\nもっと何か、できることはないかなぁって。", "zh": "我们可是《雷欧》的伙伴嘛！\n所以我就在想，还有没有什么能做的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "adafb73bb5d4aafaf182005dcdde909da9b8985f11cccc46178807e5804ae39e", "ja": "そうだったのか……って、そのノートは？\nなんだかびっしり書き込まれているみたいだけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样……等等，那本笔记是？\n感觉里面好像写得满满当当的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "1fddd48ad5e0e08b3b677747004cfc2d7366119ca618c39f8ccfcd2257dbf486", "ja": "えへへ、これはね……じゃんっ！\nヨルノさんの、研究ノートだよ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，这个嘛……锵！\n这是夜野先生的研究笔记哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "e573740996875fe873d2c2d5db605820dfdd7d0ef96ca65983c1dfc18cbdaf03", "ja": "まずは、ヨルノさんの魅力を知りたいと思って、\nイクと作ったノ！　ロコの真似してみたんだヨ～♪", "zh": "我想先了解一下ヨルノ小姐的魅力，所以就和育一起做了这个！试着模仿了ROCO哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "1370b96fc084c7c4040af9857b8ec1ae4d2ed6c5415a305e6273028038666143", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、見てみて！\nはい、どうぞ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也来看看吧！\n给，请看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_1008", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8f7dbe5ae0278a09c27212b9862878005a2b3b383ea86a4b7d088b212fc24706", "ja": "どれどれ……うわっ！？　凄い熱量だな……！\nこれ纏めるの、大変だったんじゃないか？", "zh": "我看看……哇！？好强烈的热情啊……！\n把这些整理起来，很不容易吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2001_018ele", "source_sha256": "5842c1462cf55d8a6191e1143b7238d820def9e2d061ac52d8e4d24cb6036613", "ja": "レッスンの合間にやってたから、平気だヨ！\n調べてみて、色々わかったノ！　ね？　イク！", "zh": "因为是在课程间隙做的，所以没关系哟！\n我查了查，发现了好多事情呢！对吧，育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "adbcd7992016c92d7300ba3fb64ade9cce6c65f0dbb04610d0a569b0d21fa3d8", "ja": "うん！　ヨルノさん、昔と比べて、\n変わってないところも、たくさんあるみたい！", "zh": "嗯！Yoruno小姐和以前相比，\n好像也还有很多没有改变的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2003_030iku", "source_sha256": "ca1d88627b0dccea3e7a639354d76c42527763f1dd097d3bcbdd71971abae8a7", "ja": "ファンのみんなのために、とか……。\n歌うのが大好き、っていう気持ちとか！", "zh": "为了粉丝们什么的……  \n还有那份最喜欢唱歌的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2004_018ele", "source_sha256": "43dd354ba8a1bc237bcf41805fce82638f3bcd1b8a36cc8d4bf506029f4fbc49", "ja": "こうやってまとめると、よくわかるんだよネ～！\nどう{$P$}、すごいでしょ♪", "zh": "像这样整理起来，就能看得很明白了呢～！\n怎么样，{$P$}，很厉害吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2005_p", "source_sha256": "b41f34e848187b22c01c651b4a00a2964ab713d0978783ecb66dac6cb2241773", "ja": "ああ、すごい……！\nなあ、ふたりとも。少しこのノート、借りてもいいか？", "zh": "啊，真厉害……！\n喂，你们两个。可以借我用一下这本笔记吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2006_018ele", "source_sha256": "64992afa50ff81a11210cbfafa0dcc0377ebe628dfa754bf128f5936c661bc60", "ja": "エッ？　もちろん、いいケド……どうするノ？", "zh": "诶？当然可以……你要怎么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2008_p", "source_sha256": "fa89020c8162cbc31fe901c7b7f003ef6bee8f98fbfbd17da5e949417298d75a", "ja": "……あっ、ロコ！　いたいた。探したよ。\n今、ちょっと話を……。", "zh": "……啊，ROCO！你在这儿啊。让我好找。\n现在能不能稍微聊聊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2009_025roc", "source_sha256": "e8e4f65e4f37fd5d4bcc19d92cad17205bf0414219b4e605ef150af37b4884fa", "ja": "アンダースタンドです！", "zh": "Understand！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2010_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2011_025roc", "source_sha256": "985c796d181b818be068fd43acf9c4b81cb2d41c7d584e7405db9990b9a991a0", "ja": "{$P$}やみんなが言ってることも、\nロコがセルフィッシュなことも……わかってます。", "zh": "我也明白{$P$}和大家所说的话，也明白ROCO这样很自私……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2012_025roc", "source_sha256": "54153296ea1993b6dc1b4fd620f27e5fb8149ca94e7cc24d821104a7c8125127", "ja": "でも……イクが言うように、\n心が納得してくれないだけなんです……。", "zh": "可是……就像育说的那样，只是内心还无法接受而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2013_p", "source_sha256": "fd2f8f7e38e23340919ba1cd938ad1da93e08339cc10952838640e8b29035bc9", "ja": "ロコ……。", "zh": "ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2014_025roc", "source_sha256": "9b3fb23b708fc002412d6d838593cf1cb1ead454d043d4d7ea9417b5c4419137", "ja": "それに、同じアーティストとして、\nヨルノをリスペクトする気持ちは、変わりません。", "zh": "而且，作为同一领域的艺术家，我对夜野的敬意也不会改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2015_025roc", "source_sha256": "fd17eac6ad9d2a233685d53585e54a2f7665fbe08e01eaeef832a23ec2ece815", "ja": "ただ……。それでもやっぱり、どうしても\nアグリーメントすることができなくて……。", "zh": "可是……即便如此，果然还是无论如何都无法达成一致……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2016_p", "source_sha256": "455c2d0f10639f0eed3506838716674686fd9dc7f04cefe3baf44e5598b5008b", "ja": "ロコは、寂しかったんだよな。\n自分が尊敬した人が、変わっちゃったことが。", "zh": "ROCO很寂寞吧。因为自己所尊敬的人变了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2018_p", "source_sha256": "d0c5339596544c397132c8f25218a318940f4ec659a93ba24bcaa86b2fce9dec", "ja": "でも……いつか変わってしまうからこそ、\n残るものも、あるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "但是……正因为总有一天会改变，\n才会有些东西留下来，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2019_025roc", "source_sha256": "1f50e35bd09c8bab2b1d33f6c903545106dee27185d34f9e7627b11c4562b596", "ja": "えっ？　変わるから、残る……？", "zh": "咦？正因为会改变，所以才会留下来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2020_p", "source_sha256": "38980389e5d8bc0434cbd7d8a94f9f965d47a72b331ecd19bd89af613d9dc8ae", "ja": "アートとか、まさにそうだと思うんだ。\n今、この瞬間の輝きを、形にして残す……。", "zh": "我觉得艺术就是如此。\n将此刻、这一瞬间的光辉化作某种形式，留存下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2021_p", "source_sha256": "a8dda3310b3e48c8160b72a720e90e03397d5185f1823192a07860fbe4173eec", "ja": "変わってしまうからこそ、残したいと願って……。\nその願いから、生まれるものなんじゃないか？", "zh": "正因为会改变，才想要将它留存下来……\n不正是从这种愿望中，诞生出来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2022_025roc", "source_sha256": "06b60515d453ab0a8d6901b770a689d59dfb7da199ecfe7fc0e5c746f0cf9a23", "ja": "それは……。たしかに、その通りです。\nアートにすれば、いつまでも残り続ける……。", "zh": "没错……确实是这样。\n只要将其创作成艺术，就能永远留存下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2023_p", "source_sha256": "cfba05824a52807968bc7e0945d6556fce237955daa0a899881486a052deb275", "ja": "うん。今のロコだって同じだ。\nたとえ、ヨルノさんが変わったとしても……。", "zh": "嗯。现在的ROCO也是一样的。\n就算夜野小姐变了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2024_p", "source_sha256": "565370190fafdcbf497c5d5edd3061279aab5fcaf4c727c0bb709e2ec767c616", "ja": "好きっていう気持ちは、ロコの中に残り続けると\n思うんだ。だから、寂しく思うことはないよ。", "zh": "我觉得“喜欢”这种心情，会一直留在ROCO心中。\n所以，用不着觉得寂寞哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2025_025roc", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2026_p", "source_sha256": "45cafcd8d310b0cddac3f451edf45dd40a84be9892111a129f44b206dc0450ed", "ja": "それに……ほら。\nこのノート、見てみてくれるか？", "zh": "而且……你看。\n能帮我看看这本笔记吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2027_025roc", "source_sha256": "772b8ecdc58dc82f21d9177c21d0b5b8022cec5a1ac6250cde2467fe958b68c6", "ja": "ノート？　……こ、これは！", "zh": "笔记？……这、这是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2028_p", "source_sha256": "21c273ae7f51824aadc7e74e8d0f4eeda8362e970c3c61be3278a0c0c3672854", "ja": "そう、ヨルノオルカの研究ノートだ。\n育とエレナが書いたものだよ。", "zh": "没错，这是《夜之虎鲸》的研究笔记。\n是育和艾丽娜写的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2029_p", "source_sha256": "4ce92579f11764c96dea6923379a1e3ab351efbc7c20a44e64fb91fe21e99872", "ja": "『Q』が好きだからって、『ヨルノオルカ』を\n好きになったらいけないって事はないと思うんだ。", "zh": "喜欢『Q』，并不代表就不能喜欢『夜之逆戟鲸』吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2030_p", "source_sha256": "81e0502f9277c6b22858d99aea6e200f4949f0112eb4b580d6d4494508fd7561", "ja": "気持ちも、そうやってアップグレードしていけば……\nいつか、新しい扉が開くかも知れないぞ。", "zh": "如果连心情也这样不断升级……说不定哪天就会打开一扇新的门。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2031_025roc", "source_sha256": "cc204221f00db05f49f419268f05930bfd43a140d79e164d613225cbce3e4710", "ja": "気持ちを、アップグレード……。\nあ、あの、{$P$}！", "zh": "把心情也升级一下……。\n啊、那个，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2032_025roc", "source_sha256": "24a34258174674a0083cbf76c712ceff982d719258396c14aee9baf18966ea61", "ja": "ロコ、ふたりのところに行ってきてもいいですか！？\n今、たくさんトークしたい気持ちなの！", "zh": "ROCO，我可以去找她们两个吗！？\n我现在特别想和她们聊好多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2033_p", "source_sha256": "91fad80a3b5461701c1b0b23db1402a37d520eac3f1f7e9b73d698ff39ec95c6", "ja": "もちろん。ふたりとも、\nまだレストスペースにいるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "当然可以。她们两个\n现在应该还在休息区吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2034_025roc", "source_sha256": "a26cab6d050a3ce605cd937e9a218e36ef8c5ac15be2b49dbcbe42055da2e442", "ja": "ベリーサンクスです！　イク、エレナーっ！", "zh": "非常感谢！育、艾莲娜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2035_p", "source_sha256": "facc454cb75b14df76f1085c6f06e19f8333028173c9a326e15b954b35c4814d", "ja": "（ロコは迷いのない足取りで駆けて行った……\nよし！　これでどうにか、落ち着いたかな？）", "zh": "（ROCO迈着毫不犹豫的步伐跑开了……好！这下总算冷静下来了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2036_null", "source_sha256": "b85c51cb785f1a994de0735525b49201776973018eee9024d499db7b2da124b4", "ja": "そして、対談、後半戦……", "zh": "然后，是对谈的后半部分……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2037_025roc", "source_sha256": "44be88cb64439d00092247e820de58ee70667ec355303bd4b7b1b7cf2cad5bbd", "ja": "ヨルノ！　この前は、ソーリーでした。\n『Q』のトークばかりしてしまって……。", "zh": "ヨルノ！上次真是抱歉。一直光顾着聊《Q》……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2038_025roc", "source_sha256": "702ee1ee5adaf7ad10ed60e6c3eeb24d1b0747b734831c1ce76ece4fed99c9eb", "ja": "ロコは、昔のあなたの作品が大好きでしたけど……\n今の作品も、やっぱり大好きみたいです！", "zh": "ROCO以前非常喜欢您的作品……不过现在的作品，看来也还是非常喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2039_025roc", "source_sha256": "8a6f79ff2d114a0d90613fbae02435d8a1ae86c848635b110aa50e493601611d", "ja": "今日は、そんな思いをアートにしてきました！\nこの絵を受け取ってくれませんか？", "zh": "今天，我把这份心意创作成艺术品带来了！\n你愿意收下这幅画吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2040_yorunooruka", "source_sha256": "435cf4c7bcd138f0d1628d8960acc06f74af447a85e934b4a53911bb0110475c", "ja": "えっ？　わざわざボクに？　あ、ありがとう……\n……うわっ、デッカ！？　ええと……。", "zh": "诶？还特意送给我？啊、谢谢……\n……呜哇，好大！？呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2041_yorunooruka", "source_sha256": "896dc34e0a701a12276ee6b21d45ebb8acad6fdc692804a06f822449c7586377", "ja": "これは……ファンに囲まれてるボク？", "zh": "这就是……被粉丝包围的我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2042_025roc", "source_sha256": "a852219caa198473aa379845697145de5e06c9eb23632651856f69ac13527240", "ja": "イエスです！　ずっと変わらない、あなたの魅力を……\n精いっぱい、エクスプレッションしてみました♪", "zh": "没错！我尽全力表现出了您那始终不变的魅力……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2043_030iku", "source_sha256": "c6de93fd9bc8f0fab946cacdb94a3101d0b4a2d6fbaa6bb4a900851ca9d49285", "ja": "カラフルなところとか、ヨルノさんの絵に似てるかも！\nすっごくあったかい感じだよね♪", "zh": "比如色彩缤纷的地方，说不定和约伦先生的画很像！\n感觉特别温暖呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2044_yorunooruka", "source_sha256": "466a9efdf41d78e21d589a5beb94d80eacc697c43364f380fd9e3a4417c9292f", "ja": "ずっと変わらない……。\n……。ありがとう、その……嬉しいよ。すごく。", "zh": "一直都没有改变……。\n……谢谢，那个……我很开心。真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2045_018ele", "source_sha256": "23f1a8d34ecbb7ad047143017cb510632a995531d736c0e0cb916ef89fe817ec", "ja": "やったネ、ロコ！　喜んでもらえて、\nワタシも嬉しいヨ～！　踊りたくなっちゃった♪", "zh": "太好了呢，ROCO！能让你开心，我也很高兴哦～！都忍不住想跳舞了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2046_025roc", "source_sha256": "43e5f821302f87d073a4bb6d74df991320f346f5d3367db66ecc06d13032da73", "ja": "えへへ、サンクスです、エレナ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢啦，艾蕾娜♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2047_025roc", "source_sha256": "eacac44bac6419ac96e32d0efdff02a03d779683db7d364619011dce472372ff", "ja": "ヨルノ！　ロコはあなたのファンですけど、\nアーティストとしては、ライバルでもあります！", "zh": "ヨルノ！　ROCO是你的粉丝，不过作为艺术家，也是你的对手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_05_2048_025roc", "source_sha256": "cdd0b258bc31a699868ecd11d6dbd3d0c85a3c0db82de3c986a9c8af94413b5f", "ja": "これからもお互いに、たくさんのアートを\n生み出していきましょうね♪", "zh": "今后我们也一起创作出许多艺术作品吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
